"Tigu is secretly a Spirit Beast in human form; a few allies know and keep it quiet."
"Before Jin reformed her, Tigu delighted in blinding, crippling and maiming enemies."
"Lord Zhong Kui, the King of Ghosts, blessed Tigu in a vision and named her 'Rou Tigu'."
"Later, Tigu runs an ethics test for new White Tiger recruits."
